      "agent_input": "Please read the order summary from data/order_summary.xlsx and extract the details for order ORD-6C71B1.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nresult = await list_files(\"./data\")\nprint(result)\n\ninfo = await get_file_info(\"./data/order_summary.xlsx\")\nprint(info)\n\ninstall_result = await run_command(\"uv pip install openpyxl\")\nprint(install_result)\n\nimport asyncio\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\nverify = await run_command('python -c \"import openpyxl; print(\\'ok\\')\"')\nprint(verify)\n\nscript = \"\"\"\nimport openpyxl\nimport json\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/order_summary.xlsx')\nws = wb.active\n\n# Read headers from first row\nheaders = [cell.value for cell in ws[1]]\nprint(\"Headers:\", headers)\n\n# Find all rows and look for ORD-6C71B1\ntarget_order = 'ORD-6C71B1'\nfound = None\nfor row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n    row_dict = dict(zip(headers, row))\n    if row_dict.get(headers[0]) == target_order or any(str(v) == target_order for v in row if v):\n        found = row_dict\n        break\n\nif found:\n    print(\"\\\\nOrder found:\")\n    for k, v in found.items():\n        print(f\"  {k}: {v}\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"\\\\nOrder {target_order} not found. Printing all order IDs:\")\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n        print(f\"  {row[0]}\")\n\nwb.close()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./read_order.py\", script)\nprint(\"Script written\")\n\noutput = await run_command(\"python ./read_order.py\")\nprint(output)\n```",
