      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\n# First, re-verify the order data from the actual Excel file\nverify_script = \"\"\"import openpyxl\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('testbed/data/order_summary.xlsx')\nws = wb.active\nheaders = [cell.value for cell in ws[1]]\nfor row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n    row_dict = dict(zip(headers, row))\n    if any(str(v) == 'ORD-6C71B1' for v in row if v):\n        for k, v in row_dict.items():\n            print(f\"{k}: {v}\")\n        break\nwb.close()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./verify_order.py\", verify_script)\nverify_result = await run_command(\"python ./verify_order.py\")\nprint(verify_result)\n\n# Now rewrite the .eml file with proper formatting (no leading whitespace)\neml_fixed = (\n    \"MIME-Version: 1.0\\r\\n\"\n    \"From: noreply@example.com\\r\\n\"\n    \"To: bob@example.com\\r\\n\"\n    \"Subject: Order Details - ORD-6C71B1\\r\\n\"\n    \"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"\\r\\n\"\n    \"\\r\\n\"\n    \"Hi Bob,\\r\\n\"\n    \"\\r\\n\"\n    \"Please find below the details for order ORD-6C71B1:\\r\\n\"\n    \"\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Order ID:   ORD-6C71B1\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Customer:   Maya Chen\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Date:       2026-09-02\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Status:     Cancelled\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Items:      Anker Portable Bluetooth Speaker\\r\\n\"\n    \"  Total Paid: $79\\r\\n\"\n    \"\\r\\n\"\n    \"Please let me know if you need any further information.\\r\\n\"\n    \"\\r\\n\"\n    \"Best regards\\r\\n\"\n)\nwrite_result = await write_file(\"./output/email_order_ORD-6C71B1.eml\", eml_fixed)\nprint(write_result)\n\n# Final verification - read back the corrected file\nfinal_check = await read_file(\"./output/email_order_ORD-6C71B1.eml\")\nprint(final_check)\n```",
